WEBVTT

00:00:02.260 --> 00:00:04.650
Hello there! I am the Thread Weaver.

00:00:05.250 --> 00:00:07.550
Every stitch tells a story, doesn't it?

00:00:10.850 --> 00:00:14.300
Now, I will weave the light
into something beautiful.

00:00:15.100 --> 00:00:16.400
Perfect.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:18.850
Just a few more stitches to go.

00:00:20.650 --> 00:00:22.000
Hold on tightly now!

00:00:25.100 --> 00:00:26.750
The clock's tempo is fracturing.

00:00:27.200 --> 00:00:28.550
We must mend this rift.

00:00:29.150 --> 00:00:30.750
Time will bend to our will.

00:00:33.550 --> 00:00:35.450
I will seal this rift!

00:00:35.800 --> 00:00:37.100
Time will flow again!

00:00:37.350 --> 00:00:38.750
Hold together!

00:00:41.100 --> 00:00:44.450
Welcome to our beautiful and serene world of creations.
